        },
        {
          "word": " small.",
          "start": 1173.39,
          "end": 1173.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's another word... In other words, that Wa (and) is there.",
      "start": 1174.43,
      "end": 1177.75,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " There's",
