          "end": 1185.83,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You see, the reason why I raised the question is because we are told in the Quran that",
      "start": 1187.99,
      "end": 1193.17,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " You",
          "start": 1187.99,
