        {
          "word": " criterion.",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No grief and no fear.",
      "start": 3246.26,
      "end": 3246.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " No",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " grief",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " fear.",
          "start": 3246.26,
          "end": 3246.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I want you to listen to me. I'm gonna repeat it again since God repeats in the whole Quran.",
