        },
        {
          "word": " heads.",
          "start": 3247.1,
          "end": 3247.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, just for the moment, including myself, I want to imagine that this is for you.",
      "start": 3247.1,
      "end": 3247.42,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
