          "end": 3384.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it.",
          "start": 3384.9,
          "end": 3386.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If you're grieving over anything you missed, or if you're worried about anything in the future, you are not in God's dominion.",
