          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " around.",
          "start": 3653.14,
          "end": 3653.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because these things that we have here, all these pleasures and good things, are ridiculous compared to the Hereafter.",
