    },
    {
      "text": "[3:20]  If they argue with you, then say, \"I have submitted myself to GOD; Me and those who follow me.\" And say to those who received the scripture, as well as those who did not receive any scripture, \"Do you accept Islam as your religion?\" If they do accept Islam, then they are guided. If they turn away, then your sole mission is to deliver the message. GOD is Seer of all the people.",
