    },
    {
      "text": "and don't add anything after it. He says \"the angels, God Himself\" is bearing witness to the fact",
      "start": 3756.26,
      "end": 3756.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Sabahi",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " He,",
